    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages partitions with iterator invalidation safety. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Epoch-based validity tracking for all handles</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic iterator invalidation on partition removal</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Stable ID-based access fallback patterns</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>RAII guards for partition lifetime management</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Gaps A-2-01 to A-2-04: Complete iterator safety implementation </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
